_2030168471221847_8899765092509732368_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rGEf_ToLzCAQ7kNvwGaqIgO&_nc_oc=AdqE2yOEPpOloU-UQXYbWAddepjykenJCuLMuaNpsaV1YpQsqQUwdJgbtWJVkXLsK9U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHzavPaI1PwtpuoL8JNml5tNB7xOP0ab2NAqis5GlLbVQ&oe=6A8EE079"}, {"file_name": "4 (1).png", "id": "1378872840756685", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827646_1378872844090018_7962378696679324928_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D59mJBDLUfgQ7kNvwE-wV6K&_nc_oc=AdqOCbJ1c9XDI-xTN6NGs90CTbKKiUfgpczJGYJ0l3CqZXfQH4qIukUpQV23dwzRVHU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEGDDl7tCUc8T4xEp-slmQGvHxIb7l315QiXZ3W67sS0Q&oe=6A8ED91E"}, {"file_name": "5 (1).png", "id": "1305208408488374", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_1305208411821707_1151686396768565523_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zpd03s-OowwQ7kNvwHxkbLM&_nc_oc=AdrE5hoi3jZ2EA-6OG4kDzFgWimA53lhVD7dRl-5nRKMGAKcrglmZDyGXZlLq3cA1Hg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFvGYL2ussIm6M29Kd1a3cOa1yu78mdeAbRltkYsQKAiQ&oe=6A8ED00D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Lethal ape Reworked", "keywords": ["Horror", "Free", "Multiplier", "Simulation", "Facility"], "long_description": "Lethal Ape Reworked is a fast-paced survival horror VR experience where you step into the role of a primate trapped inside a dark, abandoned facility. Using immersive gorilla-style movement, you must swing, climb, and navigate through pitch-black corridors and experimental zones while being hunted by a relentless, unknown creature.\n\nEvery sound matters. Every movement could give away your position. Whether you play solo or with friends, the goal is simple: survive the depths of the facility and escape before whatever is lurking in the shadows finds you.\n\nBuilt for full VR immersion, Lethal Ape VR combines tense 